======
RULES
======

( Stopping animation )
[ StuckU2 ] -> [ ]
[ StuckD2 ] -> [ ]
[ StuckL2 ] -> [ ]
[ StuckR2 ] -> [ ]
[ StuckV2 ] -> [ ]
[ StuckH2 ] -> [ ]
[ StuckU1 ] -> [ StuckU2 ] again
[ StuckD1 ] -> [ StuckD2 ] again
[ StuckL1 ] -> [ StuckL2 ] again
[ StuckR1 ] -> [ StuckR2 ] again
[ StuckV1 ] -> [ StuckV2 ] again
[ StuckH1 ] -> [ StuckH2 ] again

( Falling animations )
[ PlayerFall2 ] -> [ PlayerFall3 ]
[ PlayerFall1 ] -> [ PlayerFall2 ] again

[ CoinFall2   ] -> [ CoinFall3   ]
[ CoinFall1   ] -> [ CoinFall2   ] again

[ RockFall3   ] -> [             ]
[ RockFall2   ] -> [ RockFall3   ] again
[ RockFall1   ] -> [ RockFall2   ] again

( Remember when there's player input )
[ moving Player ] -> [ moving Player Input ]

( Do nothing else when there's a fallen player or coin )
[ Lost ] [ Player ] -> [ Lost ] [ stationary Player ]
[ Lost ] [ Input  ] -> [ Lost ] [ ]

( Remove all locks and holds. These are purely visual )
[ Lock ] -> [ ]
[ Hold ] -> [ ]

( Players move connected Tech )
vertical   [ parallel Player TechV ] -> [ parallel Player parallel TechV ]
horizontal [ parallel Player TechH ] -> [ parallel Player parallel TechH ]

( Cores move parallel Tech )
startloop
vertical   [ parallel CoreV | ... | TechV ] -> [ parallel CoreV | ... | parallel TechV ]
horizontal [ parallel CoreH | ... | TechH ] -> [ parallel CoreH | ... | parallel TechH ]
vertical   [ parallel TechV | ... | CoreV ] -> [ parallel TechV | ... | parallel CoreV ]
horizontal [ parallel TechH | ... | CoreH ] -> [ parallel TechH | ... | parallel CoreH ]
endloop

( Tech tries to move connected objects )
[ > Tech Move ] -> [ > Tech > Move ]

( Iteratively stop objects )
startloop

( Stop for obstacles )
vertical   [ > Tech Wall ] -> [ Tech Wall StuckV1 ] again
horizontal [ > Tech Wall ] -> [ Tech Wall StuckH1 ] again
up    [ > Player | stationary StopP no Stuck ] -> [ Player StuckU1 | StopP ] again
up    [ > Coin   | stationary StopC no Stuck ] -> [ Coin   StuckU1 | StopC ] again
up    [ > Rock   | stationary StopR no Stuck ] -> [ Rock   StuckU1 | StopR ] again
down  [ > Player | stationary StopP no Stuck ] -> [ Player StuckD1 | StopP ] again
down  [ > Coin   | stationary StopC no Stuck ] -> [ Coin   StuckD1 | StopC ] again
down  [ > Rock   | stationary StopR no Stuck ] -> [ Rock   StuckD1 | StopR ] again
left  [ > Player | stationary StopP no Stuck ] -> [ Player StuckL1 | StopP ] again
left  [ > Coin   | stationary StopC no Stuck ] -> [ Coin   StuckL1 | StopC ] again
left  [ > Rock   | stationary StopR no Stuck ] -> [ Rock   StuckL1 | StopR ] again
right [ > Player | stationary StopP no Stuck ] -> [ Player StuckR1 | StopP ] again
right [ > Coin   | stationary StopC no Stuck ] -> [ Coin   StuckR1 | StopC ] again
right [ > Rock   | stationary StopR no Stuck ] -> [ Rock   StuckR1 | StopR ] again
[ > Player | stationary StopP ] -> [ Player | StopP ]
[ > Coin   | stationary StopC ] -> [ Coin   | StopC ]
[ > Rock   | stationary StopR ] -> [ Rock   | StopR ]

( Stop connected tech )
[ Tech stationary Grab ] -> [ stationary Tech Grab ]

( Stopped tech stops parallel tech )
vertical   [ parallel TechV | ... | stationary TechV ] -> [ TechV | ... | TechV ]
horizontal [ parallel TechH | ... | stationary TechH ] -> [ TechH | ... | TechH ]

( Stopped tech stops connected objects )
vertical   [ stationary TechV parallel Grab ] -> [ TechV Grab ]
horizontal [ stationary TechH parallel Grab ] -> [ TechH Grab ]
endloop

( Objects move connected tech )
[ > Move Tech ] -> [ > Move > Tech ]

( Player collects coins )
[ > Coin   | stationary Player ] -> [          | Player ] sfx3
[ > Player | stationary Coin   ] -> [ > Player |        ] sfx3

( Unattached tech is destroyed )
[ Tech no Grab ] -> [ ]

( If any player moved on input, play the move sound effect )
[ Input ] [ > Player ] -> sfx1

( If no players moved on input, play the stop sound effect )
[ Input ] [ > Player ] [ stationary Player ] -> [ Input ] [ > Player ] [ action Player ]
[ Input ] [ stationary Player ] -> sfx2
[ Input ] [ action Player ] -> [ Input ] [ Player ]

( Which objects are over a void )
late [ Move Void ] -> [ Move Fall Void ]

( Which objects are indirectly held up by the floor )
startloop
late vertical   [ CoreV no Fall | ... | TechV Fall ] -> [ CoreV | ... | TechV ]
late horizontal [ CoreH no Fall | ... | TechH Fall ] -> [ CoreH | ... | TechH ]
late vertical   [ TechV no Fall | ... | CoreV Fall ] -> [ TechV | ... | CoreV ]
late horizontal [ TechH no Fall | ... | CoreH Fall ] -> [ TechH | ... | CoreH ]
endloop

( Make players and objects fall )
late [ Player Fall ] -> [ PlayerFall1 no Tech ] sfx4 again
late [ Coin   Fall ] -> [ CoinFall1   no Tech ] sfx4 again
late [ Rock   Fall ] -> [ ROckFall1   no Tech ] sfx5 again

( Remove falling markers )
late [ Fall ] -> [ ]

( Show which cores and rails are locked to each other )
late vertical   [ CoreV | ... | CoreV ] -> [ CoreV HoldV | ... | CoreV HoldV ]
late horizontal [ CoreH | ... | CoreH ] -> [ CoreH HoldH | ... | CoreH HoldH ]
late vertical   [ CoreV | ... | RailV ] -> [ CoreV HoldV | ... | RailV LockV ]
late horizontal [ CoreH | ... | RailH ] -> [ CoreH HoldH | ... | RailH LockH ]

( Remove player input )
late [ Input ] -> [ ]



